{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_2_039_01_c",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:c2908f07175141a357f9c1f7e12f7d56b54dfcf76e2a9894ee561d2bdc189113",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_2_039mcr_01_1_2_039_01:1_2_039_01_c:cmd-000012:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:17afb6c906b0c7f2dfbfd058e9b4c4aae6953010e93e9781c547976acc9ed58a",
      "text": "走失的小鸟，是吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_039mcr_01_1_2_039_01:1_2_039_01_c:cmd-000016:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6895e29c53de1d993ce013ad61db6b1fa6888bd4a86fe586af6ee2393dfa6f35",
      "text": "我家拉面店所在的那栋综合大楼里，\n还有各种各样的其他店铺嘛。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_039mcr_01_1_2_039_01:1_2_039_01_c:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bc1c765798207e46e1ef6036c4a67accca198e928ff86a619692fb3c299eb5ba",
      "text": "比如个人经营的卡拉OK、\n占卜馆，还有小酒吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_039mcr_01_1_2_039_01:1_2_039_01_c:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ba49cf74ed82a1e077e7ba1678e1d3c703d6ede498fe20a73ccdc75faa0ba90e",
      "text": "那个小酒吧的老板娘养的小鸟，\n好像走失不见了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_039mcr_01_1_2_039_01:1_2_039_01_c:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:126887d183e6d1a339c73fff6dde1cea200709978d1ecef4ee213378e7955c44",
      "text": "以大楼里开侦探事务所的人为中心，\n现在大家都在一起找那只小鸟呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_039mcr_01_1_2_039_01:1_2_039_01_c:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3832d3c8abcf95ed950def7436a2dd47b18ee1d363dd29d77bdbe54360335d76",
      "text": "原来是这样啊……\n那真是让人担心呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_039mcr_01_1_2_039_01:1_2_039_01_c:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4c78a9445aaea63f1e9b0f07b2921615fe379466080a772ce1a922ffa59ce2dc",
      "text": "我们那栋楼里的人，\n一直以来都是互帮互助着走过来的，",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_039mcr_01_1_2_039_01:1_2_039_01_c:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:39d4e2d2fe1373c74a14d662df11f82e4e0385740690f76b3a2bcfae44d14254",
      "text": "有人遇到困难的话，我就想出一份力嘛。\n话虽如此，这几天却一点线索都没有。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_039mcr_01_1_2_039_01:1_2_039_01_c:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:40a93a0dbfe8f3a7df7c2f4e1812ee3ba1f45ac549db5119e67d8ad33ceaeb93",
      "text": "我也知道光着急是没用的，\n虽然心里明白……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_039mcr_01_1_2_039_01:1_2_039_01_c:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a49c09c8e033d3c9c6072906694b9568504bff087e82bf2e8e1e61d40a8e07f8",
      "text": "……道流先生。\n既然这样，试试这种方法怎么样？",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
